 ],
 "note": "CY74FCT2244T prints OEA/OEB, DA0-3/OA0-3, DB0-3/OB0-3 (cy74fct2244t p.1 pinout, Q = DBQ and SO = DW). Logic diagram p.2: OEA enables DAn -> OAn, OEB enables DBn -> OBn; function table p.2 (OE L: O = D, H: Z). Same positions as the '244 (OEA = 1OE, DAn = 1A(n+1), OEB = 2OE, DB0 at pin 17 = 2A4). CY-QC rows (CY74FCT2244ATQC-TI, CTQC, TQC) are tube QSOP orderables not in the packaging table, given the Q (DBQ) pinout. CY74FCT2244TS0C (digit zero) left out as a typo of CY74FCT2244TSOC. 25-ohm series output resistors not modeled.",
